<title>HUNGARY: Hungary O/N rates end at 20.50 pct in calm trade.</title>
<headline>Hungary O/N rates end at 20.50 pct in calm trade.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungarian overnight rates closed unchanged on Monday in low turnover, dealers said.</p>
<p>Overnight rates finished at Friday's closing level of around 20.50 percent.</p>
<p>&quot;There was an offer at the end of 20.125 but no takers,&quot; said Gabor Liener of Unicbank.</p>
<p>Dealers said they did not see any market moving factors.</p>
</text>
